@startuml RTES_Order_Flow

title Order Flow: BUY 100 AAPL @ $150.00

actor "Trading Client" as Client
participant "TCP Gateway" as Gateway
participant "SPSC Queue 1" as Q1
participant "Risk Manager" as Risk
participant "SPSC Queue 2" as Q2
participant "Matching Engine\n(AAPL)" as Engine
participant "Order Book" as Book
participant "MPMC Queue" as Q3
participant "UDP Publisher" as UDP
database "Order Pool" as Pool

== Order Submission ==
Client -> Gateway: TCP: NewOrderMessage\n(BUY 100 AAPL @ $150.00)
activate Gateway
Gateway -> Gateway: epoll detects readable
Gateway -> Gateway: recv() bytes
Gateway -> Gateway: Parse MessageHeader
Gateway -> Gateway: Validate CRC32 checksum
Gateway -> Gateway: Extract auth token
Gateway -> Pool: allocate()
Pool --> Gateway: Order*
Gateway -> Q1: push(Order)
Gateway --> Client: OrderAck (PENDING)
deactivate Gateway
note right: ~2μs

== Risk Validation ==
Q1 -> Risk: pop(Order)
activate Risk
Risk -> Risk: check_symbol_allowed() ✓
Risk -> Risk: check_order_size() ✓
Risk -> Risk: check_price_collar() ✓
Risk -> Risk: check_rate_limit() ✓
Risk -> Risk: check_duplicate() ✓
Risk -> Risk: check_credit_limit() ✓
Risk -> Risk: update_client_state()
Risk -> Q2: push(Order)
deactivate Risk
note right: ~1μs

== Matching ==
Q2 -> Engine: pop(Order)
activate Engine
Engine -> Engine: capture old BBO\n(bid=$150.50, ask=$150.60)
Engine -> Book: add_order(Order)
activate Book
Book -> Book: acquire mutex
Book -> Book: check duplicate ✓
Book -> Book: order_lookup_[id] = order
Book -> Book: match_limit_order()
Book -> Book: Check crossing:\n$150.00 >= $150.60? NO
Book -> Book: Add to bids_[$150.00]
Book -> Book: order->status = ACCEPTED
Book -> Book: release mutex
Book --> Engine: success
deactivate Book
Engine -> Engine: Check BBO changed:\nbid=$150.00 (was $149.90) ✓
Engine -> Q3: push(BBO_UPDATE)
deactivate Engine
note right: ~5μs

== Market Data Publishing ==
Q3 -> UDP: pop(BBO_UPDATE)
activate UDP
UDP -> UDP: Serialize to binary
UDP -> UDP: Calculate HMAC
UDP -> Client: UDP Multicast\n(239.0.0.1:9999)\nBid: $150.00 (100)\nAsk: $150.60 (200)
deactivate UDP
note right: ~1μs

note over Client, UDP
  **Total Latency: ~9μs**
  Gateway: 2μs | Risk: 1μs | Matching: 5μs | UDP: 1μs
end note

@enduml
